<title>UK: Petroleum Finance sets energy conference for April.</title>
<headline>Petroleum Finance sets energy conference for April.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Former U.S. Defence Secretary Dick Cheney, chairman of Halliburton, will address the Petroleum Finance Company's annual conference in Washington on April 8-9, Petroleum Finance said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The conference will examine the impact of government and politics on the international oil and gas industry.</p>
<p>Speakers also include Petroleos de Venezuela President Luis Giusti, Texaco Chief Executive Peter Bijur, British Petroleum Managing Director Rolf Stomberg, Arco International President Jay Cheatam and Unocal President John Imle.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
